msgstr "USDC केवल Solana नेटवर्क पर भेजें। किसी अन्य नेटवर्क पर भेजे गए USDC नहीं पहुंचेंगे।"

#. The last USDC payout still pending since provider payouts moved to the UR subnet; shown on the Solana wallet block and, while no Solana wallet is connected, next to the wallet actions, only while a USDC amount is pending. Mirrors the email headline.
